  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Mixed media artists' sculpture which unfolds to form a four-paneled screen. Collage on exterior and interior walls using illustrations of birds, postage stamps, beadwork and found objects. Interior contains alphabet cubes, mirrors and one shelf with mounted orange cone.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Title and imprint information from dealer's catalog.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"I've used the parrots in this piece to represent grand observers of all they purvey ... some are headless and yet stand guard. Some gaze out and question the viewer to their intentions. Others look inward wondering about what surrounds them. And, the postage travels ... meandering through different cities and countries...gaining marks, prints, dings and dents. I wish I could travel as cheaply as a stamp to see the world!"--Artist's statement.</subfield>
